F calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids in Jasper County came in under 90% of normal in 39 of 75 years for both May to June and September to October. In 2025, September to October on the middle came in at 53% of normal. So far in 2026, February to March was 44% of normal on the middle, and April to May was 112%. Grid 12145 had its driest year in 1954 at 57% of normal.</p>"}
